eved <span class=\"nowrap\">November 1,</span> 2022</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=CBS+News&amp;rft.atitle=17+amazing+Google+Easter+eggs&amp;rft.date=2011-11-11&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cbsnews.com%2Fpictures%2F17-amazing-google-easter-eggs%2F2%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A42+%28number%29\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Niiya, Brian. Japanese American history: an A-to-Z reference from 1868 to the present. Facts on File, Inc., 1993, p. 352</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.eqiad.main‐7d45657b68‐xvt57\nCached time: 20260925165120\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Module:Citation/CS1 (os.date(%Y))\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [prevent‐selective‐update, show‐toc, vary‐revision‐sha1, vary‐revision‐exists]\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.102 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 150/1000000\nRevision size: 3688/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 3746/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 6/100\nExpensive parser function count: 2/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5286/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.046/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 2632153/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   91.375      1 -total\n 59.75%   54.601      2 Template:Cite_web\n 28.12%   25.698      1 Template:Main\n  2.13%    1.947      2 Template:H2G2\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID 55283bcd-b901-11f1-ad62-3743426f7b85 -->\n</div>"}}